  "title": "NXP Semiconductors’ Jeff Palmer to Retire, Mike Lucarelli Named Senior Vice President of Investor Relations",
  "summary": "EINDHOVEN, The Netherlands, June 24, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NXP Semiconductors N.V. (NASDAQ: NXPI) today announced that Jeff Palmer, Senior Vice President of Investor Relations, has decided to retire following a distinguished 16-year career with the company.",
